    "parent_id": "8ece7f27-58c4-4338-9d12-2da5ec3947e8",
    "content": "# Standard Operating Procedure: Production API Deployment ## 1. Overview and Pre-Deployment Gates\nAll microservices deployed to production Kubernetes clusters must pass automated CI/CD pipeline checks before traffic migration.",
    "chunk_type": "child",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "metadata": {
      "doc_id": "b1708bb1-9a2d-4290-98bf-77103e7e3e73",
