    "parent_id": "97a0d167-457d-44b9-8d52-2ce4dc822a01",
    "content": "- Maximum outperformance (125%+ ARR target): 200% target payout cap. ## 3.",
    "chunk_type": "child",
    "chunk_index": 3,
